OL,3,GNEWSAMy rapist got community work while
OL,4,AI have a life sentence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has shared her disappointment
OL,7,Fand frustration about the decision not
OL,8,Fto review her rapist's sentence.
OL,10,FThe woman, who cannot be named for
OL,11,Flegal reasons, was attacked when she
OL,12,Fwas 17 by fellow student Thomas Woodall
OL,13,Fon her first night at a Gloucestershire
OL,14,Fcollege. Her attacker, now 19, was
OL,15,Ffound guilty of rape and sentenced to
OL,16,Fthree years in custody suspended for
OL,17,Ftwo years and given 200 hours of unpaid
OL,18,Fwork.
OL,20,F"I've been let down. He's got such a
OL,21,Flenient sentence whilst I have a life
OL,22,Fsentence," she said.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
