OL,3,GNEWSAMy rapist got community work while
OL,4,AI have a life sentence
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut despite the outcome, the woman said
OL,7,Fsharing her story "brought more closure
OL,8,Fthan when he was found guilty" - and
OL,9,Fshe encouraged survivors of sexual
OL,10,Fviolence to report to police.
